      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Peso-Pesado. Hippowdon se irrita com uma facilidade surpreendente. Ele mantém a enorme boca aberta para exibir sua força assustadora e levanta grandes quantidades de areia ao atacar.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 10 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Hippowdon é a evolução final de Hippopotas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Bite, Fire Fang, Ice Fang, Sand Attack, Tackle, Thunder Fang, Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Dig, Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Sandstorm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Sand Tomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Crunch, Roar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Rest</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Earthquake</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Double-Edge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Fissure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Slack Off</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Amnesia, Attract, Body Press, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Confide, Crunch, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endure, Facade, Fire Fang, Frustration, Giga Impact, Hard Press, Heavy Slam, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, High Horsepower, Hyper Beam, Hyper Voice, Ice Fang, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Mud Shot, Mud- Slap, Muddy Water, Protect, Rest, Return, Revenge, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scorching Sands, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Swagger, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thunder Fang, Toxic, Water Pulse, Weather Ball</p>",
